  "title": {
    "text": "Regions with more migration tend to churn more, but the link is weak outside London, Scotland and NI",
    "subtitle": [
      "ITL2 regions, 2012\u201324. Correlation 0.64 across all regions; 0.30 for England & Wales outside London.",
      "Moves between ITL2s in the same English region or nation (e.g. within London) excluded. Scotland and NI data come from different sources.",
